026-08-04T16:52:30Z"},"body":"This works by propagating a newly added notification through the tree, which various physics nodes react to.\r\n\r\nIt also adds a debugger message to notify the running game of changes to the Debug > Visible Collision Shapes menu item.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2072\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11790\r\n- Supersedes #120076\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78a14bf7-29b6-410e-aa89-5373514fef8d\r\n\r\nThe embedded game turning blank is probably an artifact of my system.\r\n\r\nIt does not work on CSG nodes, but it seems like this has been broken for a while: #119812 This PR calls the right things so as soon as that bug gets fixed, it should start working here too.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119816/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2